-- AC datas : OLD Title : "REUSE", Title AC enUS : "REUSE" OLD Description : "$N，如果你准备就绪的话，在艾萨拉有一位名叫奥汀克的熊怪猎人，他聪明博学，经验丰富。或许他能训练并指导你。$B$B奥汀克居住在艾萨拉埃达拉斯废墟东北部的悬崖顶部。", Description AC enUS : "$N,when you feel you are ready,there is a wisened furbolg hunter by the name of Ogtinc who resides in Azshara.  He may be able to enhance your teaching,and provide you with guidance.$b$bOgtinc is atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara." ; Reason : Locale datas strictly equals to AC enUS, no more data available from WoWHead
