-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我们的战士训练师奥莉希亚派来的信使把这块符记交给了我，看起来奥利希亚有话要跟你说，看看符记上写了些什么，然后把符记给她带去吧。", Description AC enUS : "This sigil was given to me by a messenger from our warrior trainer, Alyissia. It seems Alyissia would have words with you when you have a moment. Read it and bring it to her afterwards." ; Wowhead enUS : "Read the Simple Sigil and speak to Alyissia in Shadowglen."
