UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '和铁炉堡军事区的大元帅斯诺·落雪谈一谈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8795;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "你好，我很高兴你愿意听我说话。联盟需要一切可以获得的帮助来准备发动安其拉战争，这意味着，我们需要你！现在，官方的资源收集者正在收集必需的资源储备，但是如果没有你的帮助的话，我们是无法达成目标的，$N！$B$B你应该和负责此事的大元帅斯诺·落雪谈一谈。你觉得怎么样？你是否愿意帮助联盟做好战争的准备？", Description AC enUS : "Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Alliance needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, $N!$B$BYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Field Marshal Snowfall. What do you say, $c? Will you help out with the vital preparations?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Field Marshal Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '和铁炉堡军事区的大元帅斯诺·落雪谈一谈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8796;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "你好，我很高兴你愿意听我说话。联盟需要一切可以获得的帮助来准备发动安其拉战争，这意味着，我们需要你！现在，官方的资源收集者正在收集必需的资源储备，但是如果没有你的帮助的话，我们是无法达成目标的，$N！$B$B你应该和负责此事的大元帅斯诺·落雪谈一谈。你觉得怎么样？你是否愿意帮助联盟做好战争的准备？", Description AC enUS : "Hello, I'm glad that you've decided to hear me out. The Alliance needs all of the help that it can get to prepare for the Ahn'Qiraj War, and that means that we need you! Even now as we speak, official collectors are gathering the necessary material needed for the upcoming war, but we won't be able to meet our goals without your assistance, $N!$B$BYou should go speak with the guy in charge, Field Marshal Snowfall. What do you say, $c? Will you help out with the vital preparations?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Field Marshal Snowfall in Ironforge's Military Ward."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '和铁炉堡军事区的大元帅斯诺·落雪谈一谈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8797;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "听着……我本不该告诉你这些，不过既然你是个大英雄……$B$B今年到处都有新鲜的冬青树茁壮成长，不过它们很快就会枯萎。我们弄了一台机器，可以储藏冬青树，然后在夏天拿出来热卖！$B$B我可以让你使用我们储藏的冬青树，不过你必须得是个够资格的大厨！给我带来一些石中盐，还有两个，不，三个，我是说五个金币。你觉得怎么样？够划算吧？", Description AC enUS : "Listen... I'm not really supposed to be telling you this, but since you're the hero of the day and all...$B$BThere's fresh holly everywhere this time of the year, but it never lasts.  We've got a machine that preserves holly - it never goes bad!  We use it to spice up the holiday... and profits during the summer!$B$BI'll let you use the preserver, but only if you're a master cook.  You'll need some deeprock salt and two, three, oh let's say five gold.  It'll net you a nice batch that's yours to keep." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 1 Deeprock Salt and 5 gold coins to the Holly Preserver machine, upon which you will receive 5 Preserved Holly."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '将1份石中盐和5个金币交给冬青树储藏器，以换取5棵冬青树。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8799;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "一旦你完成了分配给你的任务，就去找铁匠瓦古斯谈谈。让他看看你在战斗中得到的徽章。他会为你提供一些合适的装备。", Description AC enUS : "As you complete the tasks you're assigned in the war you'll want to talk to Vargus, the blacksmith.  Show him any badges you've earned along the way. He'll provide you with gear to match your level of commitment to our cause." ; Wowhead enUS : "Talk to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '与希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯谈一谈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8800;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "安其拉的高墙摇晃起来。超越这世界的邪恶力量已经被摧毁了。$B$B当你注视着巨像憎恶的遗迹时，心跳几乎被冻结。在死一般的寂静中，你还是能感觉克苏恩的邪恶力量。$B$B你完成了别人认为不可能的任务。$B$B你取下恶魔的眼柄小心放进你的包包里。$B$B把克苏恩之眼带到下一个房间里的巨龙那儿。", Description AC enUS : "The walls of Ahn'Qiraj tremble. A force of evil, older than the world itself, has been destroyed.$B$BAs you look at the remnants of the colossal abomination your heart nearly freezes. Even in death you can feel the legacy of C'Thun's evil around you.$B$BYou have done what was thought to be impossible.$B$BYou grab at an eye stalk of the fiend, stowing it safely in your pack.$B$BTake the Eye of C'Thun to the dragons in the next chamber. " ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Eye of C'Thun to Caelastrasz in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '将克苏恩之眼交给安其拉神殿的凯雷斯特拉兹。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8801;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "到时光之穴去吧，$N$g大人:女士。阿纳克洛斯还在等你回去呢。把克苏恩之眼交给他，我相信他一定会很乐意在自己的收藏品中增加这么一件东西。", Description AC enUS : "To the Caverns of Time you go, $G Lord:Lady; $N. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把克苏恩之眼交给时光之穴的阿纳克洛斯。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8802;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "目前塞纳里奥要塞涌入了大量的新兵，我们的首要问题就成了如何保证他们在沙漠中生存下来。缺水的环境和遍布希利苏斯的剧毒生物都威胁着这些缺乏经验的志愿者。去收集一些必需的物资，把他们交给要塞里的卡兰德拉斯吧。", Description AC enUS : "With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert.  Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers.  Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Smoked Desert Dumplings to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing I in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把4份纯水之球、4份特效抗毒药剂和4份烤鲑鱼交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的卡兰德拉斯。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 I才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8804;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "目前塞纳里奥要塞的骑兵团缺乏足够的毛皮护甲片，去收集大量护甲片，然后立即把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹队长。", Description AC enUS : "The mounted division of the Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of ornate mithril boots.  Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 3 Ornate Mithril Boots to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing II in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把3双精制秘银战靴交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 II才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8805;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "塞纳里奥要塞的卫兵急需磨刀石。去收集足够的磨刀石，然后立即把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹队长。", Description AC enUS : "The Cenarion Hold guard is in short supply of grinding stones.  Procure a batch and deliver them immediately to Captain Vish Kozus in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 10 Dense Grinding Stones, 10 Solid Grinding Stones and 10 Heavy Grinding Stones to Vish Kozus, Captain of the Guard at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing III in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把10块致密砂轮、10块坚固的砂轮和10块重砂轮交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的维斯·库鲁兹。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 III才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8806;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "战场的绷带储存量在最近战争伤亡之后急剧降低。把大量的急救物资带给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。", Description AC enUS : "Geologist Larksbane's studies have proven to be of tremendous value to our operations in Silithus.  She has recently requested scrying materials to be used in her research.$B$BPlease gather these materials and deliver them to her directly so that she may continue her research." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 1 Large Brilliant Shard, 1 Large Radiant Shard and 1 Huge Emerald to Geologist Larksbane at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing V in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把1份大块魔光碎片、1份大块强光碎片和1块巨型绿宝石交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的地质学家拉克斯班。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 V才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8807;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "战场的绷带储存量在最近战争伤亡之后急剧降低。把大量的急救物资带给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。", Description AC enUS : "The latest influx of volunteers has caused a shortage of uniforms.  Procure a batch of uniform materials and bring them to Windcaller Proudhorn." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 1 Mooncloth, 2 Bolts of Runecloth and 1 Ironweb Spider Silk to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing VIII in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把1块月布、2卷符文布卷和1份铁网蛛丝交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 VIII才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8808;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "瓦古斯是塞纳里奥要塞的铁匠，他需要一些附魔材料来为我们的部队制作强力的武器。去找到这些材料，把它们直接交给瓦古斯，这样塞纳里奥议会的军队就有了作战装备的保障。", Description AC enUS : "Vargus, Cenarion Hold's blacksmith, has requested enchanted materials to be used in the crafting of powerful weapons for our forces.  Obtain these and bring them directly to Vargus so that Cenarion Hold's troops may continue to be well equipped." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 2 Enchanted Thorium Bars and 2 Enchanted Leather to Vargus at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing IX in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把2块魔化瑟银锭和2块魔化皮交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的瓦古斯。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 IX才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8809;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我们的绷带储备在最近接连不断的战事之后急剧降低。收集大量的急救物资，把它们交给塞纳里奥要塞的唤风者梅恩·长角。", Description AC enUS : "Our supply of bandages in the battlefield is running dangerously low after the recent casualties we have incurred.  Obtain a batch of first-aid supplies and deliver them to Windcaller Proudhorn in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages, 30 Heavy Silk Bandages and 30 Heavy Mageweave Bandages to Windcaller Proudhorn at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing X in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把30根重符文绷带，30根厚丝质绷带和30根厚绒线绷带带给唤风者梅恩·长角。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 X才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8810;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我听说冬天爷爷已经把许多礼物放在了铁炉堡的圣诞树下，今年烟林牧场又慷慨地赞助了不少钱！我很想去看看，但是我更想一睹PX-238型欢乐制造器。$B$B如果你没事的话，最好去看一看，我相信冬天爷爷的礼物中也有你的一份。", Description AC enUS : "I hear Greatfather Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Ironforge. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Greatfather Winter has some presents with your name on them." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Greatfather Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Ironforge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '与冬天爷爷谈一谈。他就在铁炉堡的烟林牧场商人附近。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8827;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我听说冬天爷爷已经把许多礼物放在了铁炉堡的圣诞树下，今年烟林牧场又慷慨地赞助了不少钱！我很想去看看，但是我更想一睹PX-238型欢乐制造器。$B$B如果你没事的话，最好去看一看，我相信冬天爷爷的礼物中也有你的一份。", Description AC enUS : "I hear Great-father Winter - with the generous support of Smokeywood Pastures - has put presents for everyone under the tree in Orgrimmar. I wish I could go, but I've got to look after the PX-238 Winter Wondervolt.$b$bBut you should definitely check it out. I'm sure Great-father Winter has some presents with your name on them." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Great-father Winter. He is located near the Smokywood Pastures vendor area in Orgrimmar."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '与冬天爷爷谈一谈。他就在奥格瑞玛的烟林牧场商人附近。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8828;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "终极的伪装", Title AC enUS : "The Ultimate Deception" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Ultimate Deception",  OLD Description : "暮光之锤的运作机制有着数不清的保密措施。虽然他们的身影在世界各地出现，但他们策划阴谋的大本营却是在一个我们不知道的地方。$B$B我们相信暮光之锤用以召唤头目的石头可以用来进行双向传送，因此我们要尝试使用它。当然，我们必须仿造一件暮光大使的长袍。$B$B把必需的材料交给奥蕾尔·金叶，$n。", Description AC enUS : "The Twilight's Hammer operates through innumerable layers of secrecy and deceit.  While their actions are carried out in our world, they are planned in a place we have not yet been able to reach.$B$BWe've come to believe that the stones the Twilight's Hammer uses to summon their superiors allow for two-way transportation.  To attempt to use them in this manner, we must replicate - to every last detail - a twilight emissary's robe.$B$BGather the necessary materials and bring them to Aurel Goldleaf, $N.  " ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring a Skin of Shadow, 3 Frayed Abomination Stitchings and 1 Twilight Cultist Robe to Aurel Goldleaf at Cenarion Hold in Silithus.  You must also bring Logistics Task Briefing XI in order to complete this quest."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '沙漠生存包', `Details` = '将1块暗影之皮、3条磨损的憎恶缝合线和1件暮光信徒长袍交给塞纳里奥要塞的奥蕾尔·金叶。你还必须随身带着后勤任务简报 XI才能完成这个任务。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8829;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "五部落荣誉徽章", Title AC enUS : "Five Signets for War Supplies" ; Wowhead enUS : "Five Signets for War Supplies"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '五枚荣誉徽章换取物资', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8851;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "目前塞纳里奥要塞涌入了大量的新兵，我们的首要问题就成了如何保证他们在沙漠中生存下来。缺水的环境和遍布希利苏斯的剧毒生物都威胁着这些缺乏经验的志愿者。去收集一些必需的物资，把他们交给要塞里的卡兰德拉斯吧。", Description AC enUS : "With the arrival of fresh recruits to Cenarion Hold comes the problem of keeping them alive in the desert.  Dehydration as well as numerous poisonous creatures present a serious threat to inexperienced volunteers.  Gather the supplies necessary for a desert survival kit and bring them to Calandrath in Cenarion Hold." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 4 Globes of Water, 4 Powerful Anti-Venom and 4 Baked Salmon to Calandrath at the inn in Cenarion Hold in Silithus."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把4份纯水之球、4份特效抗毒药剂和4份烤鲑鱼交给希利苏斯塞纳里奥要塞的卡兰德拉斯。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8856;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我正在寻找那些经过战争洗礼的冒险者，看他们是否愿意从亚什巨像的尸体上取到新鲜的獠牙样本，并把它交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普。不，不，我可不希望你在那家伙的尸体附近游荡。你只需迅速取回样本，这东西腐烂了就不好办了！", Description AC enUS : "I'm looking for battle hardened adventurers willing and able to get a fresh husk sample from the fallen Colossus of Ashi to Oglethorpe in Booty Bay. No, no, I wouldn't want you to go anywhere near that thing's corpse. Just take one of my samples and make it snappy. These things are no good to him rotten!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Colossus of Ashi's Husk to Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '把亚什巨像的獠牙交给藏宝海湾的奥格索普·奥布诺提斯。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8857;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "巨像的秘密 - 雷戈", Title AC enUS : "Secrets of the Colossus - Regal" ; Wowhead enUS : "Secrets of the Colossus - Regal",  OLD Description : "我只想把这个甲虫壳套在奥菲斯特的大肥脸上…可惜，我现在要在这里收集畸形的蟑螂样本。我会一直在这里直到清晨。$B$B快点帮我把这个样本带给奥菲斯特，$c。他会重重答谢你!$B$B没错，瑟银哨塔 – 就在灼热峡谷。", Description AC enUS : "There ain't nothin' I'd like more than to stuff this bug husk down Oilfist's fat face... Cept, I'm stuck here collectin' samples from that overgrown cockroach. I'll be here 'till the wee mornin' hours given the size o' that thing.$B$BTake this here sample to Oilfist fer me and do it fast, $c. He's payin' BIG!$B$BYar, Thorium Point - it be in the Searin' Gorge." ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Colossus of Regal's Husk to Overseer Oilfist in Searing Gorge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '雷戈巨像的秘密', `Details` = '把雷戈巨像的獠牙交给灼热峡谷的工头奥菲斯特。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8858;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "巨像的秘密 - 佐拉", Title AC enUS : "Secrets of the Colossus - Zora" ; Wowhead enUS : "Secrets of the Colossus - Zora",  OLD Description : "我的奴仆差点在取得这个样本时丧命。你一定要动作快！玛克斯韦尔·泰罗索斯男爵急需要一个新鲜的甲壳样本。他相信巨像的秘密可以帮助我们对抗天谴军团！$B$B你怎么还在这里！？到圣光之愿礼拜堂！没错，你会得到可观的奖励…", Description AC enUS : "My servants were nearly killed in their efforts to recover this sample. You absolutely must hurry! Lord Maxwell Tyrosus eagerly awaits a fresh husk sample. He believes that the secrets of this Colossus could help us in the war against the Scourge!$B$BWhy are you still here!? To Light's Hope! Yes, you will be rewarded handsomely for your efforts...$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Take the Colossus of Zora's Husk to Lord Maxwell Tyrosus at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '佐拉巨像的秘密', `Details` = '把佐拉巨像的獠牙交给东瘟疫之地圣光之愿礼拜堂的玛克斯韦尔·泰罗索斯男爵。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8859;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "暴风城正在举行新年庆典！所有人都可以全天畅饮美酒佳肴，晚上还会有焰火表演！听起来是不错……不过藏宝海湾也有这样的庆典，我敢说这个肯定更棒！$B$B总之，暴风城的旅店老板奥里森需要一些烟林牧场的补给品才能应付需求量巨大的庆典，你能帮我送一趟货吗？$B$B谢谢你，$n！旅店老板奥里森在镶金玫瑰旅店，就在暴风城的贸易区里。", Description AC enUS : "Stormwind is holding a celebration for the new year!  All day long today you can get free booze, and at night they'll put on a firework show!  It should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!$B$BWell anyway, Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers.  Can you do me a favor and deliver it!$B$BThanks, $N!  Innkeeper Allison is in the Gilded Rose, in the Trade District of Stormwind." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Smokywood Supplies to Innkeeper Allison in Stormwind."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '将烟林补给品交给暴风城的旅店老板奥里森。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8860;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "雷霆崖正在举行新年庆典！所有人都可以全天畅饮美酒佳肴，晚上还会有焰火表演！听起来是不错……不过藏宝海湾也有这样的庆典，我敢说这个肯定更棒！$B$B总之，雷霆崖的旅店老板帕拉需要一些烟林牧场的补给品才能应付需求量巨大的庆典，你能帮我送一趟货吗？$B$B谢谢你，$n！帕拉的旅店就在通往猎人高地的吊桥边。", Description AC enUS : "Thunder Bluff is holding a celebration for the new year!  All day you'll find free booze there, and at night they'll put on a firework show!$B$BIt should be pretty nice... but Booty Bay is also having a party today; I bet it'll be even better!$B$BWell anyway, Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff needs a supply of Smoky Wood Pasture fare to help feed all the party goers.  Can you do me a favor and deliver it!$B$BThanks, $N!  Innkeeper Pala is in the inn near the bridge to Hunter's Rise." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Smokywood Supplies to Innkeeper Pala in Thunder Bluff."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '将烟林补给品交给雷霆崖的旅店老板帕拉。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8861;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "每年月光林地的德鲁伊们都会举行庆典，纪念我们打败远古恶魔的日子。$B$B我们赞美长者的智慧，共享美食盛宴，当然……我们还会燃放烟花！$B$B这些不是普通的烟花表演，$N。这些烟花承载着月神的赐福，用月火点燃它们，以此来祝愿大家健康。$B$B你只需付出一点点花费，就可以从我们的商人那里购买一些五颜六色的烟花，然后在周围的发射器上点燃它们。", Description AC enUS : "Every year the druids of Moonglade hold a celebration of our city's great triumph over an ancient evil.$B$BWe celebrate the wisdom of our elders, share in magnificent feasts and of course... shoot fireworks!$B$BFor a small donation you can purchase colorful rockets from our vendor.  Try using some of the launchers around here, $N." ; Wowhead enUS : "Launch 8 Lunar Fireworks and 2 Cluster Fireworks and return to a Lunar Festival Harbinger at any capital city."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '点燃8枚春节烟花和2组春节烟花束，然后回到任何一座主城的春节预告者身边。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8867;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "年兽曾经是这个世界的英雄，一头充满着力量、能给人带来幸运的巨狼。在上古之战时，它和其他的英雄一起对抗燃烧军团，但最终却被恶魔腐蚀，成为了邪恶的野兽，在艾泽拉斯传播恐惧与死亡。$B$B最终，它在月光林地这里被打败了，并长眠在月神湖底。但是每年的这个时候，在春节期间，它都会苏醒……$B$B集结你的军团吧，$n，召唤并打败年兽，艾露恩将赐予你祝福！", Description AC enUS : "The beast Omen was once a hero of this world.  A wolf of great strength and fortune, Omen fought beside the heroes of the War of the Ancients until he succumbed to demonic magics.  Turning against his allies, he raged across Azeroth and carried death and terror in his wake.$B$BFinally defeated here, in Moonglade, Omen now sleeps among the silt of Lake Elune'ara.  But each new year, during the festival, he stirs...$B$BGather cohorts, $N, and summon and defeat the beast Omen.  Earn the blessing of Elune!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Summon Omen, defeat him and gain Elune's Blessing.  Return to Valadar Starsong in Nighthaven"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '召唤年兽，击败它，并获得艾露恩的祝福。完成任务之后回到永夜港的瓦拉达尔·星歌那里。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8868;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "甜蜜的宁静", Title AC enUS : "Sweet Serenity" ; Wowhead enUS : "Sweet Serenity",  OLD Description : "平静之剑位于血色堡垒内，红衣铸锤师以生命守护着它。打败他，并将他的围裙交给我。作为报答，我将训练你成为锻造战锤的铁匠。$B$B不过你要知道，一旦你选择成为铸锤师，就不能再学习打造刀剑和战斧的技艺了。", Description AC enUS : "Within the confines of the Scarlet Bastion lies sweet Serenity. The Crimson Hammersmith guards the recipe with his life. Defeat him and bring me his apron. For that, I shall train you to become a hammersmith.$B$BUnderstand this: Once you have chosen the path of the hammersmith, the paths of the swordsmith and axesmith will no longer be available.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "Travel to Stratholme and kill the Crimson Hammersmith. Recover the Crimson Hammersmith's Apron and return to Lilith."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '甜美的平静', `Details` = '到斯坦索姆去杀死红衣铸锤师。将红衣铸锤师的围裙交给莉莉丝。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8869;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。", Description AC enUS : "It's that time of the year, $N!  The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival.  You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight.  She can tell you more about the holiday." ; Wowhead enUS : "Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger in the Mystic Ward of Ironforge.  You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '与铁炉堡秘法区的春节预告者交谈。当然，你也可以到其他主城中去寻找当地的新年预报者。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 8870;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "春节将至，$n！塞纳里奥议会邀请所有艾泽拉斯的居民参加我们的新年庆典活动。你可以在这座城市中寻找一个有神圣的月光之环标记的地方，我们的春节预告者就在那里！她可以告诉你更多关于这个节日的细节信息。", Description AC enUS : "It's that time of the year, $N!  The Cenarion Circle invites all denizens of Azeroth to partake in our celebration of the Lunar Festival.  You will find the Lunar Festival Harbinger in this very city at a location marked by a blessed circle of moonlight.  She can tell you more about the holiday." ; Wowhead enUS : "Talk to the Lunar Festival Harbinger in the Park District in Stormwind.  You can also talk to Lunar Festival Harbingers in other capital cities."
