-- AC datas : OLD Title : "碎地者头盔", Title AC enUS : "Earthshatter Headpiece" ; Wowhead enUS : "Earthshatter Headpiece",  OLD Description : "你可以将为了防守这片土地而倒下的勇士护甲带来给我吗?$B$B护甲已被亵渎，无疑是正被恶魔使用；不过，只要有被战争破坏的护甲碎片，被亵渎的护甲就可以复原并再次被批上战场。$B$B将死者的遗物和净化材料带来给我，碎地者护甲就会是你的。$B$B寻找纳克萨玛斯。", Description AC enUS : "Would you honor me by returning the armor of those that fell in the defense of these lands?$B$BThe armor has been desecrated and is undoubtedly being used for evil; however, with wartorn armor scraps, the desecrated armor can be renewed and worn for battle once more.$B$BBring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don.$B$BSearch Naxxramas." ; Wowhead enUS : "Rimblat Earthshatter at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make an Earthshatter Headpiece if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Headpiece, 15 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 4 Arcanite Bars and 2 Nexus Crystals."
