-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我不介意。我们也要充份利用我们的情况……以我来说，就是武器。或许也可能成为我最好的武器。$B$B没错，就这么办。一个锐利的刀口，一个坚固的刀柄……我喜欢它的音调。$B$B我要你去帮我收集一些东西。", Description AC enUS : "I wouldn't mind that.  We might as well make the best of our situation... in my case,being a weapon.  Might as well become the best weapon I can be.$B$BYes,let's do that.  A sharper edge,a sturdier hilt... I like the sound of that.$B$BI'll need you to gather a few things for me." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 9652;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我不介意。我们也要充份利用我们的情况……以我来说，就是武器。或许也可能成为我最好的武器。$B$B没错，就这么办。一个锐利的刀口，一个坚固的刀柄……我喜欢它的音调。$B$B我要你去帮我收集一些东西。", Description AC enUS : "I wouldn't mind that.  We might as well make the best of our situation... in my case,being a weapon.  Might as well become the best weapon I can be.$B$BYes,let's do that.  A sharper edge,a sturdier hilt... I like the sound of that.$B$BI'll need you to gather a few things for me." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game."
