-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$c，你已经做出了选择。那么，不管前方的路有多么凶险，你都得走下去。$B$B你要明白，与达拉然的大法师们搞好关系是大有裨益的。为我们服务吧，你的努力不会白费的。", Description AC enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c.  Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$B$BYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages.  Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Honored reputation with the Violet Eye."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '当你在紫罗兰之眼的声望达到尊敬后，将紫罗兰徽记交给逆风小径的大法师蕾尔达。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 10733;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$c，你已经做出了选择。那么，不管前方的路有多么凶险，你都得走下去。$B$B你要明白，与达拉然的大法师们搞好关系是大有裨益的。为我们服务吧，你的努力不会白费的。", Description AC enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c.  Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$B$BYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages.  Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Honored reputation with the Violet Eye."
