-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$c，你已经做出了选择。那么，不管前方的路有多么凶险，你都得走下去。$B$B你要明白，与达拉然的大法师们搞好关系是大有裨益的。为我们服务吧，你的努力不会白费的。", Description AC enUS : "You've chosen your path, $c.  Now it is up to you to travel the path to wherever it may lead.$B$BYou will find that having friends among the Archmages of Dalaran has its advantages.  Serve us well and your deeds will not go unrewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Honored reputation with the Violet Eye."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '当你在紫罗兰之眼的声望达到尊敬后，将紫罗兰徽记交给逆风小径的大法师蕾尔达。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 10736;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "大师之触", Title AC enUS : "The Master's Touch" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Master's Touch",  OLD Description : "我已经将这把曾还是个学徒时使用过的钥匙重新拼接好了。虽然它现在看起来应该具备了以前钥匙的功能，但你还是没法用它来打开卡拉赞的大门。事实上，它现在就跟一块废铁一样。$B$B没有麦迪文调和这把钥匙中的魔法力量，它就完全没有任何价值。是的，没错，我知道麦迪文已经死了。但事情并非已经完全没有希望。$B$B艾泽拉斯世界那边有一处地方名叫时光之穴，被青铜龙军团所守护着。你只要找到那里，就可以回到过去找到麦迪文，让他调和这把钥匙中的魔法力量。", Description AC enUS : "I've put together the very key I used as an apprentice.  It looks completely functional as far as keys go.  In regards to opening Karazhan, however, this might as well be a piece of scrap metal.$B$BWithout Medivh's consent, the key is worthless.  Yes, of course I know Medivh is dead.  This merely makes things difficult, not impossible$B$BThere is a place in Azeroth called the Caverns of Time, guarded by the bronze dragonflight.  Find a way inside, travel back in time and get Medivh to enable the key." ; Wowhead enUS : "Go into the Caverns of Time and convince Medivh to enable your Restored Apprentice's Key."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = 'DEPRECATED', `Details` = '前往时光之穴，劝说麦迪文为你重铸Apprentice''s Key。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 10737;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$N，你没有令我们失望。不过，我们也对你寄予了更大的期望。$B$B继续为紫罗兰之眼效力吧，你会得到满意的回报的。", Description AC enUS : "You have not disappointed us, $N.  We continue to have very high hopes for you, however.$B$BContinue to serve the Violet Eye and you will be appropriately rewarded." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring your Violet Signet to Archmage Leryda at Deadwind Pass after obtaining Revered reputation with the Violet Eye."
