-- AC datas : OLD Description : "哼！你以为这是什么啊？ 测试任务吗？ 就算文字有错，我还是在那里！$B$B如果你以为我的任务很简单的话，那你就倒大楣了！$B$B帮我杀10只羊(1933)，在你完成前别回来见我！", Description AC enUS : "Bah! What do think this is, some kind of Test Quest? I be there even be typos in it!$B$BIf ya be thinkin' my quest is goin' ta be easy, then ya got another thing coming!$B$BKill me ten sheep (1933) and don't come back until you do!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Kill 6 sheep for Benny and then run like hell!$b$b$b$b$bJust kidding... about the running part."
