-- AC datas : OLD Description : "你好，$c。我们没多少时间了。龙喉氏族的兽人们已经在靠近南方的大峡谷构筑了自己的工事。$b$b他们拒绝执行酋长的命令，因此我们别无选择，只能消灭他们，让他们永远不再玷污部落的名字。", Description AC enUS : "Throm-ka,$c. There is no time to waste. Orcs of the Dragonmaw clan have fortified themselves in the valley to the south of here. $b$bThey have denied the Warchief's mandate,leaving us only one course of action. We will eliminate them so that they will no longer dirty the name of the Horde." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Kill 8 Dragonmaw Raiders, 3 Dragonmaw Bonewarders, and a Dragonmaw Battlemaster."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务被暴雪标记为过期，无法获得或完成。杀掉8个龙喉袭击者、3个龙喉白骨守卫和1个龙喉军官。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 242;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "<UNUSED>", Title AC enUS : "<UNUSED>" ; Wowhead enUS : "<UNUSED>",  OLD Description : "Hello there, $n. I've heard much about your exploits, and must say I'm honored to meet you. I don't suppose you've heard the story of Ol' Kelt? Ah, well, Ol' Kelt--Kelt Thomasin, that is--was once considered one of the finest hunters in all the realm. There wasn't much he hadn't done, but then, one day, he became obsessed with an ancient story... a myth, really. Well, as the stories go, a huge threshadon lives in the waters of the lake. Hogwash, if you ask me. If you're interested, you might talk to Kelt.", Description AC enUS : "Hello there,$n. I've heard much about your exploits,and must say I'm honored to meet you. I don't suppose you've heard the story of Ol' Kelt? Ah,well,Ol' Kelt--Kelt Thomasin,that is--was once considered one of the finest hunters in all the realm. There wasn't much he hadn't done,but then,one day,he became obsessed with an ancient story... a myth,really. Well,as the stories go,a huge threshadon lives in the waters of the lake. Hogwash,if you ask me. If you're interested,you might talk to Kelt." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Talk to Kelt Thomasin."
