-- AC datas : OLD Description : "了解这片土地有多危险对你的将来大有好处，$c。$B$B这里的野生物可以教会我们这些……只要我们有足够的智慧和观察力。$B$B蝎子就是在杜隆塔尔求得生存的典范。想要生存下去的话，你不妨去向它们学习。它们坚硬的甲壳可以让你免受烈日的折磨，甚至可以抵挡致命的攻击。$B$给我找6个巨钳蝎身上的Small Scorpid Carapaces回来，$N，我会留意给你应得的奖赏。", Description AC enUS : "You would do well to learn how dangerous this land can be,$c.$B$BThe wildlife here can teach us such things... if we are wise and observant.$B$BThe scorpids are a perfect example of survival in Durotar. If you are to survive,it would be wise to take on some of their characteristics as your own. Their hardened carapaces can protect you from the harshness of the sun,or even a deadly weapon.$B$BBring me 6 Small Scorpid Carapaces from the Clattering Scorpids,$N,and I shall see about rewarding you justly." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Bring 6 Small Scorpid Carapaces to Kor'ghan in Sen'jin Village."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务被暴雪标记为过期，无法获得或完成。找6个Small Scorpid Carapaces 带给Sen''jin Village的Kor''ghan。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 810;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "烧饭和打扫——这些就是我的工作。$B$B如果你想吃东西，就先给我带点肉来！我可没工夫整天给你们这些寄生虫打猎。你要想得到平等的待遇，就得学会尽你的本分。$B$B如果你想让自己看上去不是个废物，或者不想活活饿死的话，就去给我找点野猪肉回来。", Description AC enUS : "Cook and clean--that's all I do!$B$BYou want to eat,you get me some more meat! I don't have all day to hunt and prepare food for all these louses. You got to learn to pull your own weight around here if you wanna be treated equal.$B$BGet me some Chunks of Boar Meat if you want to make yourself useful... or you don't want to starve to death." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Bring 10 Chunks of Boar Meat to Cook Torka in Razor Hill."
