-- AC datas : OLD Description : "<布理安娜用搜索的目光看了你一眼。>$B$B$B$B那么，你想杀一些哥布林，是吗？嗯，如果你下定决心，可以从附近的掠夺者开始。帮我带来他们的牙齿做为证据。", Description AC enUS : "<Brianna gives you a searching glance.>$B$BSo,you want to kill some goblins,eh? Well,if you're determined,you can start with the nearby savages. Bring me their teeth as proof of your deeds." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Brianna Schneider on Designer Island wants 10 Goblin Teeth."
