-- AC datas : OLD Description : "糟糕！我该返回沙塔斯城的孤儿院了。$B$B跟你在一起的日子非常愉快。$N，你是世界上最好的人！就像我的亲$g哥哥:姐姐一样！$B$B<萨兰蒂亚的眼中泛起泪花。>$B$B我会想你的！长大之后，我要做一个像你一样的人！！！", Description AC enUS : "Darn it all!  I guess it's time to go back to the orphanage at Shattrath City.$B$BI've had such a great time.  You're the best person in all of the worlds, $N!  You're my big $g brother : sister; now!$B$B<Salandria's eyes begin to well up with tears.>$B$BI'm going to miss you so much!!!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Return your ward to the Shattrath City orphanage by handing in the Blood Elf Orphan Whistle to Orphan Matron Mercy in the Lower City."
