-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$c，看上去你是个能干的家伙。我们来一次双赢的合作如何？$B$B皇冠公司希望将我们最新的节日主题产品小样提供给尽可能多的潜在客户。如果你能帮助我们推广我们的心血之作，也许你能得到一些非常精彩的皇冠公司产品！$B$B朋友，花些力气，我们提供令你满意的报酬，如何？", Description AC enUS : "You look like a real go-getter, $c. How about we work out a little win-win scenario?$B$BCrown's looking to offer samples of our latest holiday-themed products to as many potential customers as possible. Help us share the love, and we'll give you discounts on some great Crown merchandise!$B$BYour time, our money, friend. What do you say?" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Spray 10 people with the Crown Perfume Sprayer."
