-- AC datas : OLD Description : "你在这只箱子上找不到任何开关铰链或缝隙。如果不是你在摇晃这只箱子的时候能听到里面发出物体碰撞的声音，你一定会以为它是一整块金属。$b$b很可能只有大领主莫格莱尼才知道打开这只箱子的办法。", Description AC enUS : "You can detect no hinges or openings on this box. Were it not for the shifting of items inside,it could easily be mistaken for solid metal.$b$bIf anyone could know the method of its opening,it would be Highlord Mograine." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring the Sealed Chest to Highlord Darion Mograine in Icecrown Citadel.$b$bProvided item: $b"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '将密封的金属箱交给冰冠堡垒的大领主莫格莱尼。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 24914;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "元素研究", Title AC enUS : "Elemental Research" ; Wowhead enUS : "Subduing the Elements",  OLD Description : "[ph] I'll give you a sack of shaman stuff.  Use the elemental sapta to enter the spirit and use the totem on the Agitated Earth Elementals.", Description AC enUS : "[ph] I'll give you a sack of shaman stuff.  Use the elemental sapta to enter the spirit and use the totem on the Agitated Earth Elementals." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Gavan Grayfeather wants you to use the elemental sapta and cleansing totem from the Earthen Ring supplies to subdue 20 Agitated Earth Spirits."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '制伏元素', `Details` = '此任务被暴雪标记为过期，无法获得或完成。加文·灰羽要你使用大地之环补给品中的元素灵契和净化图腾，制服20个激动的大地之魂。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25055;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "元素研究", Title AC enUS : "Elemental Research" ; Wowhead enUS : "Subduing the Elements",  OLD Description : "[ph] I'll give you a sack of shaman stuff.  Use the elemental sapta to enter the spirit and use the totem on the Agitated Fire Elementals.", Description AC enUS : "[ph] I'll give you a sack of shaman stuff.  Use the elemental sapta to enter the spirit and use the totem on the Agitated Fire Elementals." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Seer Bahura wants you to use the elemental sapta and cleansing totem from the Earthen Ring supplies to subdue 20 Agitated Fire Spirits."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = '制伏元素', `Details` = '此任务被暴雪标记为过期，无法获得或完成。先知巴胡拉要你使用大地之环补给品中的元素灵契和净化图腾，制服20个激动的火焰之魂。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25092;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "不久以前，我的兄弟布莱恩从奥杜尔发来一份紧急报告。他说，他发现了一个古老的泰坦宝藏，从里面发掘出一些神秘而重要的宝物。乌瑞恩国王已经派遣最快的一艘船转至诺森德，将携带那些宝物的使者载送回来。那艘船现在应该已经回来了。$B$B我很担心，$N。因为我到现在都没有得到任何关于那名使者的消息。你是否能去一趟暴风城港口，看看他是不是在那里？", Description AC enUS : "Some time ago,my brother Brann sent an urgent message from Ulduar. He said he'd found an ancient titan cache with mysterious and important relics. King Wrynn dispatched one of his fastest ships to Northrend to transport the courier and the boat should've arrived by now.$B$BI'm worried,$N. I haven't heard anything about the courier's arrival. Would you be willing to travel to Stormwind Harbor and see if he's arrived?" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Bring the Tablets of Earth to Advisor Belgrum in Ironforge."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。将地之石板带给铁炉堡的顾问贝尔格拉姆。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25180;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我正在等待一名来自诺森德的使者。他随身携带着一些古老的宝物。我希望能够借助它们扫清我面前的黑暗。那位萨满应该已经乘坐飞艇而来了。我却仍然只能忧心忡忡地在这里等待。$B$B他要在奥格瑞玛大门外西南边的飞艇塔和我见面。但我不想错过觐见酋长的机会。你是否愿意帮我找到那位使者，看看是什么耽误了他？", Description AC enUS : "I'm expecting the arrival of a courier traveling from Northrend. He's carrying a collection of ancient titan treasures,ones I'm hoping will shed light on my troubling visions. The shaman should've arrived on one of the recent zeppelin flights and I'm starting to get worried.$B$BHe was to meet me by the zeppelin tower southwest of Orgrimmar's gates,but I don't want to miss my audience with the warchief. Would you be willing to look for the courier and see what's delaying him?" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Bring the Tablets of Fire to Earthmender Norsala in Orgrimmar."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。将火之石板带给奥格瑞玛的大地治愈者诺莎拉。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25181;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "嗨！看样子你能帮我们一把！$B$B如果你真的愿意帮助我们，我们就要先对你进行训练。侏儒训练相当严格，强度也相当大。所以我希望你对此有所准备。$B$B去找军士教练斯蒂姆兰克，他会向你提供你需要知道的一切。记住，一定要严格按照他的命令行动，否则你将不能完成任务。$B$B虽然我已经警告过你，但你也许还不了解你将面对怎样的困难。等你完成任务之后再来见我吧。", Description AC enUS : "Hey! You look like you could give us a hand!$B$BIf you're willing to help our cause,we have to get you through training.  Gnome training is brutal and rigorous,so I hope you're ready.$B$BHead over to Drill Sergeant Steamcrank and he'll walk you through what you need to know.  Make sure you follow his orders when he gives them,or else you'll never make it$B$BI'm warning you though,it's tough over there.  Come back to see me,if you make it." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Follow Drill Sergeant Steamcrank's cues and then report back to Captain Tread Sparknozzle."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。完成教官汽轴的命令，然后回去向崔德·火钻队长报告。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25199;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我们本以为只要耐心等待，诺莫瑞根的辐射自然会渐渐衰弱。但现在这一情况仍然没有得到改善。$B$B如果要夺回我们的城市，我们至少需要确保我们的部队能够安全进入那里。$B$B带上这些辐射计量仪，登上这里的“雷光号”，将它们投放到诺莫瑞根外面的通风口附近。它们会测量那里的辐射水平，并将相关信息返回给我。", Description AC enUS : "We thought that we could wait for the radiation to subside around Gnomeregan,but it doesn't appear to be getting better.$B$BIf we want to take back our city,we need to make sure it's safe for our troops to enter.$B$BTake these Radiageigatrons,hop in 'Thunderflash' here, and toss them at the ventilation shafts outside of Gnomeregan. They'll report the radiation levels directly to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Use Pilot Muzzlesprock's flying machine to toss Radiageigatrons at the vents surrounding Gnomeregan."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。使用飞行员杰夫·玛兹斯波克的飞行工具，将辐射计量仪投放到诺莫瑞根周围的通风口去。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25212;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我们的工程师正在为进攻诺莫瑞根而日夜不停地装配我们的战争机械，但我们现在极端缺乏驾驶员！$B$B我们的工程师开发出一种名叫激励仪的设备。它能够吸引侏儒们的注意力，并让他们有勇气响应我们的征兵号令。$B$B用它鼓舞起几名侏儒平民的勇气，然后带领他们去见铁炉堡南边，钢架补给站的崔德·火钻队长。$B$B一定要小心。这个设备还有些不太成熟。", Description AC enUS : "Our engineers have been working on getting our battle machines ready for our assault on Gnomeregan,but we're out of pilots!$B$BWe've developed a device called the Motivate-a-Tron,which prevents distraction from other sources and gives the gnome the courage to enlist.$B$BAfter motivating a few Gnome Citizens,lead them out to Captain Tread Sparknozzle out at Steelgrill's Depot,just south of Ironforge.$B$BOh,and be careful. The device is still a little experimental. ⏎ " ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Recruit Gnome Citizens from Tinker Town using the Motivate-a-Tron and lead them to Captain Tread Sparknozzle at Steelgrill's Depot."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。使用激励仪，在侏儒区征募侏儒，并率领他们返回钢架补给站，去见崔德·火钻队长。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25229;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "梅卡托克国王要我写一份战前演讲稿，但我还不能确定哪些话的演讲效果好，哪些的演讲效果会很糟糕。$B$B你能不能在本地侏儒居民面前试一下这些演讲？这个设备能产生一个梅卡托克的影像，并说出几句我写的演讲稿。$B$B让我知道演讲稿的哪部分比较好，行不？", Description AC enUS : "High Tinker Mekkatorque asked me to write a speech that he could give before the battle starts, but I just can't tell which draft is good and which ones just stink.$b$bCould you try some of them out on the local gnome residents? This device creates an image of Mekkatorque saying a few lines from each of my speech drafts.$b$bLet me know which one works, okay?" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Use the Gnomish Playback Device in front of Ozzie Togglevolt north of Kharanos, Milli Featherwhistle at Steelgrill Depot and Tog Rustsprocket outside the Kharanos Inn.  Return to Toby Ziegear when all the speeches have been given."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。分别在卡拉诺斯北边的奥齐·电环面前，钢架补给站的米利·羽哨面前和卡拉诺斯旅店外面的托格·锈链面前使用侏儒播放器。当所有演讲都播放完毕之后，回去见托比·速轮。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25283;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我们的新型步行坦克已经做好了出击准备。想不想帮我们测试一下这些小混蛋？！你当然想！$b$b首先，我们需要确认你钻进坦克之后，还能钻出来。在战场上，如果你觉得自己的坦克要爆炸了，那就得赶快出来！我见到过许多侏儒被困在爆炸的坦克里……$B$B所以，我在坦克里安装了一个弹射椅。去试试它好用不？", Description AC enUS : "We've gotta get these new mechano-tanks ready for the assault.  You ready to help test these bad boys out?!  Of course you are!$b$bFirst,we need to make sure that once you're in,you can get out.  In battle,if you think your tank is going to explode,get out!  I've seen many a gnome stay in 'til the bitter end... the tank blows up,and them along with it.$B$BWell,I've upgraded this tank with an ejection seat.  Try it out for me,will ya?" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Test out the ejection system in the Ejector Mechano-Tank."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。测试弹射型步行坦克的弹射系统。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25285;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "好哇，$N，演讲稿完成了！它能够为所有伟大的战争作序言……它鼓舞人心，雄辩无碍，能够为侏儒们清晰地指明方向。再也没有比这个更优秀的演讲稿了！$B$B把这份演讲稿交给崔德·火钻队长，然后再从他那里乘坐交通工具，把它交给大工匠梅卡托克！", Description AC enUS : "Here we go. This is the speech, $N!$b$bIt has everything to be a great battle starter: It's inspirational, has eloquent language and speaks directly to gnomes. Never has a finer speech been written!$b$bTurn this in to Captain Tread Sparknozzle and get some transportation to High Tinker Mekkatorque!" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Give the speech to Captain Tread Sparknozzle at Steelgrill Depot.$b$bProvided item: $b"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。将演讲稿交给钢架补给站的崔德·火钻队长。$b$b已提供物品：$b', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25286;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "好了，士兵。现在你证明自身能力的时间到了！$B$B拿上这份演讲稿，登上“雷光号”。这是大工匠梅卡托克最快的一艘飞船。而这份演讲稿正是梅卡托克在诺莫瑞根行动之前最迫切需要的东西。$B$B赶快出发吧！", Description AC enUS : "All right,soldier. Time to prove your worth!$B$BTake the speech and board the flying machine "Thunderflash".  It's the fastest ship to High Tinker Mekkatorque and this speech is the only thing he's waiting on before starting Operation: Gnomeregan.$B$BGo! Now!" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Ride 'Thunderflash' from Steelgrill Depot to High Tinker Mekkatorque and deliver Toby's speech."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。登上钢架补给站的“雷光号”，前往大工匠梅卡托克那里，将托比的发言稿交给他。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25287;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "既然弹射系统性能可靠，那么我们就可以进行下一步的测试了。这辆坦克有一个特殊的功能：自动规避能力！$b$b我想要你检查一下它左腿和右腿的伺服系统，还有它的自动规避系统。$b$b这很容易，很快就能完成。", Description AC enUS : "With the ejection system working,I think we're ready to test out movement.  This tank has an extra special feature: Automatic Evasive Maneuvers!$b$bI want you to check out the servos on the left leg,the right leg and the Automatic Evasive Maneuver system.$b$bThis is easy stuff,so it shouldn't take too long." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Test the Scuttling Mechano-Tank's maneuverability."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。测试高机动型步行坦克的可操控性。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25289;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "安全系统连通！马达引导！现在我们只需要确认它的火炮能正常射击。$b$b这应该不太难，$n。我们背后山丘上的步行坦克已经填装好教练弹。你只需要向附近的目标发射几轮炮火，然后就可以向我报告了。", Description AC enUS : "Safety systems,online!  Motor functions,functioning!  Now all we need is to make sure that the guns will fire.$b$bThis shouldn't be too hard,$n.  The mechano-tank on the hill behind us has been loaded with harmless pellets. Just fire off a couple rounds at the nearby targets and report back to me." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Test out the Shooting Mechano-Tank weapon systems on the nearby targets."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。利用附近的目标来测试射击型步行坦克的武器系统。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25295;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "[ph] War！", Description AC enUS : "[ph] War!" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.[ph] Log Description"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。[ph] Log Description', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25306;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "针对诺莫瑞根的多段攻击很快就要开始了，麦克尼尔·瑟玛普拉格和他的爪牙都将得到正义的审判！瑟玛普拉格在我们的家园深处已经盘踞了太长时间。一支在辐射中变异堕落的军队保卫着他。$B$B进攻马上就要开始了！准备好，新兵，这场战斗可不是软弱的人能够承受的。", Description AC enUS : "Momentarily,the multi-phased assault upon Gnomeregan will begin and Mekgineer Thermaplugg and his men will be brought to justice!  Too long has Thermaplugg festered in the depths of our home,defended by a corrupt and irradiated army.$B$BThe assault begins in but a moment! Be ready recruit,this fight will not be for the faint-hearted." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Help King Mekkatorque with the assault on Gnomeregan."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。参与梅卡托克国王进攻诺莫瑞根的战斗。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25393;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "战斗就要开始了！我们即将向那座岛屿发起攻击。所以你应该尽快做好准备。$B$B扎拉赞恩猖獗的日子不多了。", Description AC enUS : "De time for battle is now!  We'd be headin' ova to da islands soon,so you'd betta be ready.$B$BZalazane doesn't have much time left." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Help Vol'jin take back the Echo Isles and kill Zalazane."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。帮助沃金夺回回音群岛，消灭扎拉赞恩。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25445;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "这些青蛙都已经准备好了，我需要你帮我把它们送到那些岛屿上去。$B$B在森金村的东边，你能找到管理员曼雷克。他负责照管所有沃金哨兵的蝙蝠。所以他可以给你一只蝙蝠，让你飞到那些岛屿上空去。$B$B带上这口袋青蛙。我已经请求了英灵的指引。他们会升起烟雾，让你知道我需要探查哪些地方。你可以在蝙蝠背上将这些青蛙扔到冒白烟的地方。", Description AC enUS : "Wit de frogs ready to go,I be needin' ya to help me send 'em out to the isles.$B$BOn de eastern side of Sen'jin Village,ya can find Handler Marnlek. He be handlin' all the bats for Vol'jin's scouts and he can loan ya a bat to get ya out to de isles.$B$BTake dis sack' o frogs with ya. I been askin' de spirits for guidance. Dey've sent smoke to show ya where I need de eyes most. While ridin' de bat,reach into de sack and toss de frogs toward de white smoke." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.While riding a bat, use the Sack o' Frogs to place 12 attuned frogs on the markers in the Echo Isles."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。骑在蝙蝠背上，使用青蛙口袋，将12只被施法的青蛙投放到回音群岛的标志地点。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25446;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "沃金将他的战鼓交给我，让我负责训练这里的新兵。现在我唯一的问题就是找不到新兵。$B$B如果我把这面鼓借给你，你能不能在剃刀岭敲响它，代表沃金发布战争号召？只要你能激励几个巨魔来追随你，情况就完全不一样了。召集到志愿者以后，就把他们带回来，让我能训练他们。去找南边的管理员曼雷克谈谈。他会借给你一只蝙蝠，载你飞往剃刀岭。", Description AC enUS : "Vol'jin has given me his war drums and put  me in charge of trainin' da new recruits here. Only problem is we be short on new recruits.$B$BSupposin' I loaned ya dis drum,would ya use it to sound de call to war on Vol'jin's behalf in Razor Hill? If ya could even inspire just a few trolls to join da cause,it would make a difference. Once ya've convinced dem to volunteer,bring dem back to me for trainin'. Go over an' talk to Handler Marnlek to de south. He can lend you a bat for de ride to Razor Hill." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Use Vol'jin's War Drums to recruit 5 Troll Citizens in Razor Hill.$b$bYou can speak to Handler Marnlek for a bat ride to Razor Hill."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。使用沃金战鼓，在剃刀岭招募5名巨魔平民。$b$b你可以从管理员曼雷克那里借来一只蝙蝠，飞往剃刀岭。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25461;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "还记得那些你帮我制作的间谍青蛙吗？现在它们发现了一些非常有趣的信息。$B$B在东南方的一座岛上，它们发现了一头猛虎。我从没有见过那样的猛虎，就算是其它老虎在它面前也都噤若寒蝉。$B$B而且，它不但有猫科动物的野性直觉，还有人类的心智。这头强大的野兽会成为我们有力的盟友。$B$B我会为你召唤那头猛虎之魂，利用它找到那头猛虎。这样你就能向那头猛虎发起挑战。如果你能战胜它，我们夺回家园的战役就会多一份战力。", Description AC enUS : "Remember de frogs ya made into me eyes and ears? Well,dey've found somethin' interestin'.$B$BOn an island to de southeast,dey've spied a tiger even de other cats seem to fear. Dis tiger,I've never seen anythin' like it.$B$BIt hunts wit' da instincts of a cat,but de mind of a person. It could be a powerful spirit and a strong ally.$B$BI'll be callin' down the spirit o' the tiger upon ya. Use its gifts to locate this cat and challenge it. See if ya can win its aid in our battle for the isles." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.While imbued with the Spirit of the Tiger, lure the Tiger Matriarch out of hiding and use your new abilities to best it in combat."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。在被注入猛虎之魂以后，将猛虎女王从它的藏身之地引诱出来，利用你的新能力战胜它。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25470;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我们需要考虑该何时采取行动。勇士乌拉金告诉我，他的部下已经做好了准备。你和瓦妮拉则为我们搜集到了重要的情报，并找到了新的盟友。$B$B现在，我们要解读预兆，确认该何时发动进攻。$B$B在祭祀舞蹈者组成的圆环旁边找到巫医赫兹托克。只要你做好准备，他就会开始仪式。", Description AC enUS : "De time has come to start thinkin' about when to make our move. Champion Uru'zin tells me his men be ready. You and Vanira done good work gatherin' information on de enemy and findin' us new allies.$B$BNow,we read de omens. We find out when to launch de attack.$B$BFind Witch Doctor Hez'tok near the circle of ritual dancers. He be startin' de ritual as soon as ya be ready." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Talk to Witch Doctor Hez'tok near the circle of ritual dancers outside Sen'jin Village when you're ready to consult the omens."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。做好解读预兆的准备之后，就前往森金村外，同祭祀舞蹈者组成的圆环旁边的巫医赫兹托克交谈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25480;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "沃金正在指挥他的战士们为战斗进行准备。他要我转告你，去东边的那座岛上去找他和瓦妮拉。$B$B他和战士们就要向扎拉赞恩发动进攻了。$N，愿祖先之灵与你同在。如果没有你，这场战役对我们来说将只不过是一场泡影。同南边的管理员曼雷克谈一谈，他会给你一只蝙蝠，载你飞到部队的集结地去。", Description AC enUS : "Vol'jin be gatherin' his gear and readyin' de warriors. He ask me to tell ya to meet with him an' Vanira on de island to de east.$B$BFrom dere,he and de warriors will launch de attack on Zalazane. May de ancestors go wit' you,$N. Without ya,dis campaign would only be a shadow of what it become. Speak to Handler Marnlek,just to de south,an' he give you a bat to fly out to de stagin' area." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Speak to Handler Marnlek for a flight to the staging area. Meet Vol'jin on the island east of the war camp."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。同管理员曼雷克交谈，乘蝙蝠飞到集结地去。在战争营地东边的岛屿上与沃金会面。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25495;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "好哇，$N，演讲稿完成了！它能够为所有伟大的战争作序言……它鼓舞人心，雄辩无碍，能够为侏儒们清晰地指明方向。再也没有比这个更优秀的演讲稿了！$B$B把这份演讲稿交给崔德·火钻队长，看看他还需要你做些什么。", Description AC enUS : "Here we go. This is the speech, $N!$b$bIt has everything to be a great battle starter: It's inspirational, has eloquent language and speaks directly to gnomes. Never has a finer speech been written!$b$bTurn this in to Captain Tread Sparknozzle and see if there's anything else he needs of you." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Give the speech to Captain Tread Sparknozzle at Steelgrill Depot."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '此任务已经绝版。将演讲稿交给钢架补给站的崔德·火钻队长。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 25500;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "我的老朋友克拉苏斯送来消息，说龙骨荒野的龙眠神殿发生了可怕的事情。他的信非常简短。不过看样子，那座神殿下的红玉圣殿正遭受攻击。$B$B然而当下达拉然有些紧迫的事情让我不能立马亲自赶过去。我听说过你在巫妖王城堡中的事迹，相信你一定能胜任这个任务。也许你能代替我去帮助克拉苏斯？", Description AC enUS : "My old friend Krasus sends word of dire happenings at Wyrmrest, in Dragonblight. His missive was brief, but it seems that there has been some sort of attack on the Ruby Sanctum beneath the Temple.$B$BPressing business here in Dalaran keeps me from attending to the matter personally, but I have heard word of your exploits in the Lich King's Citadel and you are doubtless up to the task -- perhaps you could assist Krasus in my stead?" ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Krasus at Wyrmrest Temple in Dragonblight."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '前往龙骨荒野，和龙眠神殿中的克拉苏斯交谈。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 26012;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "$R，这座神殿下面的红玉圣殿发生了可怕的事情。$B$B进入那座圣殿的入口已经被摧毁，那里的卫士们被屠戮殆尽。我们已经派遣斥候前去调查，但他们至今还没有回来。我禁不住开始为那里感到深切的担忧。$B$B进入红玉圣殿，去看看我的家园都发生了什么。当我们得到更多信息之后，我们就能相应制定下一步策略了。", Description AC enUS : "$R, something terrible has transpired within the Ruby Sanctum beneath the Temple.$B$BThe entry to the Sanctum is in ruins, and its guardians violently slain. We sent scouts to investigate, but they have not returned. I cannot help but fear the worst.$B$BEnter the Ruby Sanctum and discover what has befallen the home of my flight. Once we have more information, we can plan our next steps accordingly." ; Wowhead enUS : "Investigate the Ruby Sanctum beneath Wyrmrest Temple."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '调查龙眠神殿之下的红玉圣殿。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 26013;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "这绝不是无谋的进攻，而是一场预谋已久，处心积虑针对红龙圣地的突袭，敌人的作战计划精细而狡猾。$B$B萨瑞瑟里安正在那边的山崖上指挥着这次攻势，但这支军队真正的首领是一头强大而自负的暮光巨龙——海里昂。他是希奈丝特拉的扭曲试验所塑造的巨龙怪物——继卓贡纳克斯之后的又一头成年暮光龙。$B$B$N，消灭他。击退这次入侵之后，去向克拉苏斯报告你在这里所见到的一切。", Description AC enUS : "This was no reckless attack, but rather a carefully orchestrated strike against the heart of the Red Dragonflight.$B$BZarithrian, on the bluff over there, is overseeing the assault, but the true leader of this force is a brash and powerful Twilight dragon named Halion. Not since Dargonax has a full-grown spawn of Sinestra's twisted experiments been seen.$B$BSlay him, $N, and then when the invasion has been fully repelled, report to Krasus regarding all you have seen here." ; Wowhead enUS : "Defeat Halion and repel the invasion of the Ruby Sanctum."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '击败海里昂和入侵红玉圣殿的敌人。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhCN' AND `ID` = 26034;

